{"id":"level-up-2026-10-21","name":"2026-10-21 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1651","en":"Participants completed a short questionnaire before joining the discussion.","zh":"参与者填写了一份简短问卷，然后参加讨论。","note":"questionnaire · 问卷， 调查表 · complete a questionnaire","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1652","en":"Finding the original plans was a major breakthrough for the restoration.","zh":"找到原始图纸是修复工作的一项重大突破。","note":"breakthrough · 突破； 重大进展 · a major breakthrough","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1653","en":"We stopped for a light snack before continuing the walk.","zh":"我们停下来吃了点小食，然后继续步行。","note":"snack · 快餐， 小吃； 点心 · a light snack","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1654","en":"The exhibition featured an amphibious vehicle designed for difficult terrain.","zh":"展览展出了一辆为复杂地形设计的水陆两用车。","note":"amphibious · 两栖的； 水陆两用的 · an amphibious vehicle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1655","en":"We reached our destination just before the last ferry departed.","zh":"我们在最后一班渡轮出发前刚好到达了目的地。","note":"destination · 目的地， 终点； 目标 · reach a destination","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1656","en":"The survey uses anonymous responses to protect participants' privacy.","zh":"这项调查通过匿名作答来保护参与者的隐私。","note":"privacy · 隐私， 私事； 隐私权 · protect privacy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1657","en":"A vertical line separates the two columns of figures.","zh":"一条竖线把两列数字分开。","note":"vertical · 垂直的； · a vertical line","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1658","en":"Repeating an unsupported story can perpetuate a misleading myth.","zh":"重复没有依据的故事可能使误导性的传说流传下去。","note":"perpetuate · 使永存； 使持续 · perpetuate a myth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1659","en":"A frustrating delay at the station made us miss lunch.","zh":"车站令人懊恼的延误使我们错过了午饭。","note":"frustrating · 令人泄气的， 使人沮丧的 · a frustrating delay","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1660","en":"The workshop addressed a common misconception about recycled materials.","zh":"这个工作坊澄清了一个关于再生材料的常见误解。","note":"misconception · 误解， 错误想法 · a common misconception","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1661","en":"Our damp clothes took hours to dry beside the heater.","zh":"我们的湿衣服在暖气旁晾了好几个小时才干。","note":"damp · 潮湿的；潮湿，湿气；使潮湿； 减弱， 抑制； 沮丧 · damp clothes","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1662","en":"The novel follows an unlikely heir to a large estate.","zh":"这部小说讲述了一个出人意料的大庄园继承人的故事。","note":"heir · 继承人 · an heir to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1663","en":"A loose screw caused the handle to wobble.","zh":"一颗松动的螺丝导致把手摇晃。","note":"screw · 螺丝，螺（丝）钉；用螺丝固定 · a loose screw","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1664","en":"Unregistered visitors must report to reception before entering the workshop.","zh":"未登记的访客进入车间前必须先到前台报到。","note":"unregistered · 未注册的 · unregistered visitors","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1665","en":"The tutor continued to emphasize the importance of checking original sources.","zh":"导师不断强调核查原始资料的重要性。","note":"emphasize · 强调， 着重 · emphasize the importance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1666","en":"The airline charged us extra because our luggage was overweight.","zh":"航空公司因我们的行李超重而收取了额外费用。","note":"overweight · 超重的，过重的；超重，过重；使负担过重 · overweight luggage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1667","en":"There is a slight difference between the two shades of blue.","zh":"这两种蓝色之间有细微差别。","note":"slight · 轻微的，微小的；侮慢；轻视，冷落 · a slight difference","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1668","en":"The previous owner left several gardening tools in the shed.","zh":"前任屋主在棚子里留下了几件园艺工具。","note":"previous · 以前的； 在…之前的； 早先的， 稍前的 · the previous owner","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1669","en":"The committee continued to argue about the proposed opening hours.","zh":"委员会继续就拟议中的开放时间争论。","note":"argue · 争论； 说服 · argue about","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1670","en":"We sheltered from the rain in a covered arcade.","zh":"我们在一条有顶拱廊里避雨。","note":"arcade · 拱廊， 有拱廊的街道 · a covered arcade","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1671","en":"A social anthropologist spent months observing daily life in the village.","zh":"一位社会人类学家花了数月观察村庄的日常生活。","note":"anthropologist · 人类学家 · a social anthropologist","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1672","en":"The family business has a distinguished pedigree in furniture making.","zh":"这家家族企业在家具制造领域拥有显赫的历史。","note":"pedigree · 家谱； 门第； 血统 · a distinguished pedigree","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1673","en":"The complexity of the pattern might daunt a beginner.","zh":"这个图案的复杂程度可能会让初学者望而却步。","note":"daunt · 使气馁， 使胆怯 · daunt a beginner","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1674","en":"The second sample showed superior quality in every test.","zh":"第二份样品在各项测试中都展现出更好的质量。","note":"superior · 上级的，较高的；优越的，优于…的，较…多的；优良的，卓越的；有优越感的，高傲的；上级， 长官 · superior quality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1675","en":"They finally managed to succeed in finding the missing records.","zh":"他们终于成功找到了丢失的记录。","note":"succeed · 成功； 接着发生 · succeed in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1676","en":"The hotel's convenient location made it easy to explore on foot.","zh":"酒店位置便利，步行游览很方便。","note":"location · 位置， 场所； 外景拍摄地 · a convenient location","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1677","en":"Passengers received compensation after the company cancelled their overnight ferry.","zh":"公司取消夜间渡轮后，乘客获得了赔偿。","note":"compensation · 补偿， 赔偿； 赔偿物， 赔偿金 · receive compensation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1678","en":"A waterproof cover is a useful accessory for this camera.","zh":"防水罩是这台相机的一件实用配件。","note":"accessory · 附件，零件； · a useful accessory","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1679","en":"The small company went bankrupt after losing its largest customer.","zh":"失去最大客户后，这家小公司破产了。","note":"bankrupt · 破产的 · go bankrupt","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1680","en":"The researcher spent winter at a remote outpost near the coast.","zh":"这位研究人员在靠近海岸的偏远站点过冬。","note":"outpost · 前哨； 偏远村落 · a remote outpost","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1681","en":"The character's private letters reveal years of mental torment.","zh":"这个人物的私人信件揭示了多年精神折磨。","note":"torment · 痛苦，折磨；令人痛苦的东西[tɔː'ment]；折磨， 使痛苦， 烦扰； 纠缠； 戏弄， 捉弄 · mental torment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1682","en":"Even small disturbances can affect the island's fragile ecosystem.","zh":"即使很小的干扰也可能影响这个岛屿脆弱的生态系统。","note":"ecosystem · 生态系统 · a fragile ecosystem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1683","en":"We attended a seminar on designing better public spaces.","zh":"我们参加了一场关于设计更好公共空间的研讨会。","note":"seminar · 研究班， 研讨会 · attend a seminar","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1684","en":"Her photograph won first prize in the local photography competition.","zh":"她的照片在当地摄影比赛中获得了一等奖。","note":"competition · 竞争； 比赛 · a photography competition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1685","en":"Our fruitful discussion produced several practical ideas for the exhibition.","zh":"富有成效的讨论为展览带来了几个切实可行的想法。","note":"fruitful · 多产的， 富饶的； 富有成效的 · a fruitful discussion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1686","en":"The walking trail continues beyond the bridge into the forest.","zh":"步道越过桥后继续延伸进森林。","note":"beyond · 在…较远的一边； 超出， 除…之外 · beyond the bridge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1687","en":"Loose cables across the floor create a serious safety hazard.","zh":"横在地板上的松散电线构成严重的安全隐患。","note":"hazard · 尝试着做； 冒…风险；危险，冒险 · a safety hazard","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1688","en":"She does voluntary work at the community garden every Saturday.","zh":"她每周六都在社区花园做志愿工作。","note":"voluntary · 自愿的， 志愿的 · voluntary work","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1689","en":"The bus provides a direct connection between campus and the station.","zh":"这条公交线路直接连接校园和车站。","note":"connection · 连接； 关系 · a direct connection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1690","en":"Please keep the receipt as proof of purchase.","zh":"请保留收据，作为购买凭证。","note":"proof · 能防…的， 耐…的；证据，证明；校样，样张 · proof of purchase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1691","en":"The biography describes a militant campaigner who refused to compromise.","zh":"这部传记描写了一位拒绝妥协的激进活动人士。","note":"militant · 好战的，好斗的；激进的；好斗的人， 激进分子 · a militant campaigner","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1692","en":"Her calm presence reassured the children during the unexpected delay.","zh":"意外延误期间，她镇定地陪在身边，让孩子们安心下来。","note":"presence · 出席； 存在； 仪态 · a reassuring presence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1693","en":"We read every page before agreeing to sign the contract.","zh":"我们读完每一页才同意签署合同。","note":"contract · 缩小； 签约；契约，合同[kən'trækt] · sign a contract","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1694","en":"The tiny bakery became a profitable business within two years.","zh":"这家小面包店在两年内成为一门盈利的生意。","note":"profitable · 有利可图的， 赚钱的； 有益的 · a profitable business","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1695","en":"We can conclude that the two samples came from different sources.","zh":"我们可以推断，这两份样品来自不同来源。","note":"conclude · 推断出； 作结论 · conclude that","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1696","en":"The delicate fabric is susceptible to damage from strong sunlight.","zh":"这种精细的面料容易受到强烈日光的损害。","note":"susceptible · 易受影响的， 易受伤害的； 易受感染的； 敏感的， 易动感情的； 能经受…的， 容许…的 · susceptible to damage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1697","en":"He found an old shilling while clearing his grandfather's desk.","zh":"他清理祖父的书桌时找到了一枚旧先令硬币。","note":"shilling · 先令 · an old shilling","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1698","en":"She carried her notebooks in a worn leather bag.","zh":"她用一个磨旧了的皮包携带笔记本。","note":"leather · 皮革， 皮革制品 · a leather bag","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1699","en":"We had to comb through boxes of papers for the receipt.","zh":"为了找收据，我们不得不仔细翻查几箱文件。","note":"comb · 梳理； 搜寻， 彻底搜查；梳子；蜂巢；肉冠，冠状物 · comb through","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:s1700","en":"Several original cottages still exist near the old mill.","zh":"旧磨坊附近仍有几间最初的农舍留存。","note":"exist · 存在； 生存 · still exist","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:w1651","en":"questionnaire","zh":"问卷， 调查表","note":"英 /ˌkwestʃə'n3ə(r)/ · 美 /ˌkwɛstʃənˈɛr/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1651-uk-01cb28e334ec.mp3","text":"questionnaire"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1651-us-0fe0c817a9c7.mp3","text":"questionnaire"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:w1652","en":"breakthrough","zh":"突破； 重大进展","note":"英 /'breɪkθruː/ · 美 /'brek'θrʊ/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1652-uk-ec2b7aa21781.mp3","text":"breakthrough"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1652-us-7f989caf2bd5.mp3","text":"breakthrough"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-21:w1653","en":"snack","zh":"快餐， 小吃； 点心","note":"英 /snæk/ · 美 /snæk/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff